    {
      "id": 126870,
      "name": "AlexxKay",
      "username": "AlexxKay",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-12T01:43:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It is definitely a super-bad situation, but part of Sentinels is ocassionally having to deal with such situations.&nbsp; (Such as <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/epic-beatdown-by-citizen-dawn-6273\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this one</a>.)</p><p>For what it's worth, if I found myself in your shoes, I would immediately de-prioritize hitting KW herself (and try to kill any environment that was doing so), except for when I could deal at least ten damage in a single turn.&nbsp; Instead, concentrate on building up Favor to twenty, and only *then* attack her directly.&nbsp; (I actully suspect that that might be a good way to deal with her in general, but am not yet sure...)</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:01:23.777Z",
