      "raw": "<p>It is definitely a super-bad situation, but part of Sentinels is ocassionally having to deal with such situations.&nbsp; (Such as <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/epic-beatdown-by-citizen-dawn-6273\">this one</a>.)</p><p>For what it&#39;s worth, if I found myself in your shoes, I would immediately de-prioritize hitting KW herself (and try to kill any environment that was doing so), except for when I could deal at least ten damage in a single turn.&nbsp; Instead, concentrate on building up Favor to twenty, and only *then* attack her directly.&nbsp; (I actully suspect that that might be a good way to deal with her in general, but am not yet sure...)</p>",
